aLinkedPoset}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SigmaLinkedPoset}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}linked\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SigmaLinkedPoset}_S(P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\left(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(X,\\leq_P)\\land\\exists\\langle P_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;\\left(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}P_n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in P_n\\;\\exists r\\in X\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}linked\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SigmaLinkedPoset}_S(P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\left(P=\\langle X,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(X,\\leq_P)\\land\\exists\\langle P_n:n\\in\\omega\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^\\omega\\;\\left(X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}P_n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in P_n\\;\\exists r\\in X\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n\">\\(P_n\\)</span> is explicitly a subset of the carrier and is linked because every pair of its conditions has a common extension.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batc